Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:01:26.36,0:01:26.39,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.58,Default,OP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 50,0:01:36.45,0:01:38.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:47.48,0:01:51.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But how are you going to kill...\Nwhat you can't understand?
Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.07,0:01:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Paper Art.
Dialogue: 50,0:01:58.69,0:02:00.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Afterimage.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.65,0:02:05.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.18,0:02:10.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're a wild one, aren't you?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:10.81,0:02:12.21,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,See, prism stone.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:30.27,0:02:32.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You backstabbing witch!
Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.61,0:02:37.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I would be a fool to fight\Nyou on even ground.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:37.60,0:02:40.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know just how strong\Nyou are, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.08,0:02:44.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope you'll forgive me.
Dialogue: 50,0:02:46.10,0:02:48.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.16,0:02:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.99,0:02:52.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK] What exactly am I\Nseeing right now?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.57,0:02:54.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why are CP0\Nfighting each other?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:55.04,0:02:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, why'd you suddenly\Nturn on these guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.08,0:02:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STUSSY chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:02:57.76,0:02:58.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You have a falling out?
Dialogue: 50,0:02:59.33,0:03:00.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is Stussy here.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.90,0:03:02.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]\NI put both of them to sleep.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.04,0:03:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened to CP0?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.76,0:03:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell us something, man!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:08.77,0:03:11.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Seems she even took\NLucci by surprise.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:13.58,0:03:14.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS] Stussy did it.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:14.95,0:03:17.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's one less thing\Nto worry about!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:16.89,0:03:18.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[YORK snores]
Dialogue: 50,0:03:17.85,0:03:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[YORK] Help me.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:19.64,0:03:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[PYTHAGORAS]\NMother of gastric distention!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:21.56,0:03:22.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,York?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.19,0:03:23.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say something, York!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:23.36,0:03:24.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.20,0:03:26.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm done.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.00,0:03:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't eat another bite.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.00,0:03:30.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:30.42,0:03:31.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Rise and shine, bucko!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.87,0:03:33.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We are neck deep\Nin the soup here!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.67,0:03:36.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, who's this Stussy person?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:36.13,0:03:37.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] She is a loyal friend,
Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.42,0:03:41.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,who's been working undercover\Nas a CP0 agent for over 20 years.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.26,0:03:41.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Undercover?
Dialogue: 50,0:03:41.98,0:03:45.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's pretty bold, sending\Na spy to an intelligence agency!
Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.10,0:03:49.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] It was not part of our original plan,\Nbut that is the way things unfolded.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.87,0:03:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[STUSSY] One issue, Doctor.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.58,0:03:54.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid my authority\Nrank is the same as Lucci's.
Dialogue: 50,0:03:54.80,0:03:57.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't override his orders\Nto the seraphim.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:03.74,0:04:06.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STUSSY] In other words,\NI can't stop them.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:09.10,0:04:10.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON] Don't worry, Stussy.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:10.37,0:04:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You did great!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:11.56,0:04:13.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith and I will take\Nit from here!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:13.69,0:04:15.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get our giant kids back!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:16.87,0:04:17.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:22.52,0:04:25.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] We gotta stop those weird\Nthings before it's too late!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the whole\Ncrew's gonna get buried!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.87,0:04:28.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:28.90,0:04:30.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But this is quite troubling.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:31.02,0:04:33.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They look hauntingly familiar.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:33.88,0:04:35.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Yeah, no kidding.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.78,0:04:38.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Especially... him.
Dialogue: 50,0:04:49.10,0:04:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI yelps]
Dialogue: 50,0:04:53.84,0:04:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ground them\Nfor a hundred years for this!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.51,0:04:59.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON] Well, at least they made\Nus a path to the outside!
Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.56,0:05:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No mercy!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:02.73,0:05:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just give them an order\Nlike normal, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.72,0:05:08.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:08.34,0:05:09.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Freedom.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.76,0:05:13.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:13.36,0:05:14.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seraphim!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:14.62,0:05:16.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got an order for ya!
Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.41,0:05:57.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess you're\Ndifferent, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:58.71,0:06:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a cold-blooded killer,\Nbut I almost sense fear from you.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:06.56,0:06:07.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Out with it!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.77,0:06:08.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:06:14.78,0:06:15.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:15.36,0:06:19.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LILITH whimpers]
Dialogue: 50,0:06:18.65,0:06:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That nearly killed me!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:23.21,0:06:24.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:24.27,0:06:25.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm putting an end to this!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.38,0:06:28.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seraphim!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.18,0:06:29.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is an order!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.86,0:06:34.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON] Stand down!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.30,0:06:38.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Edison!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.66,0:06:40.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LILITH] Edison!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:50.22,0:06:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] Right on time!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.97,0:06:53.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LILITH] You saved me.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.80,0:06:55.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps] Edison!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:58.36,0:06:59.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 50,0:06:59.14,0:07:00.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me he's okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:09.23,0:07:12.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith, darling. Please don't\Nfret another moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.74,0:07:13.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your thing's safe.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:12.97,0:07:14.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:16.63,0:07:17.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON grunts]
Dialogue: 50,0:07:19.51,0:07:21.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON] Holy motility,
Dialogue: 50,0:07:21.11,0:07:26.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that a neuropsychiatric\Nepisode or did I see Heaven?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:39.89,0:07:43.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know why, but it seems\Nlike they're done fighting.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:44.10,0:07:44.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:07:45.04,0:07:47.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You wanna tell me\Nwho they hell they are?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.51,0:07:48.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why'd they stop?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:50.12,0:07:51.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, these guys?
Dialogue: 50,0:07:51.41,0:07:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're our sweet little murder\Nbabies and we're so proud of them.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.44,0:07:56.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON] What she means is,\Nthey're our cyborgs.
Dialogue: 50,0:07:56.81,0:08:00.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CP0 gave them an order to attack us,\Nbut our authority is higher,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.02,0:08:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so when we ordered them to stop,\Nit overrode the previous command.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.57,0:08:04.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.12,0:08:06.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Mosshead?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:06.49,0:08:10.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you havin' trouble keepin'\Nup with the rest of the class?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.95,0:08:10.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO growls]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.93,0:08:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Keep up with this,\Nidiot cook!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:12.78,0:08:14.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI] Zoro-phim! Deactivate\Nyour dumbass mouth!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.93,0:08:17.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay, don't talk to me\Nlike I'm a damn cyborg!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI, ZORO shouting]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.18,0:08:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.67,0:08:18.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bastard!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.15,0:08:18.63,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.63,0:08:19.33,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stop!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:19.12,0:08:21.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we survived that mess,\Nbut what's next on the agenda?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:21.68,0:08:22.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[FRANKY] What else?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.56,0:08:25.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dr. Vegapunk gave us\Nan important mission, remember?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:25.48,0:08:27.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gettin' him\Noff this island safely,
Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.83,0:08:30.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and we're takin' all\Nhis Satellites with us!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:31.68,0:08:33.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aww. Heck yeah,\Npositive vibes!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.39,0:08:39.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[STUSSY] Shaka.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.57,0:08:40.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:08:41.93,0:08:44.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I put Sea Prism Stone\Nhandcuffs on Lucci and Kaku.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.60,0:08:46.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA]\NExcellent work, Stussy.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.97,0:08:47.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:47.87,0:08:51.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're going to have the Straw Hats\Ntake us off the island on their ship.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:51.16,0:08:53.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think it would be wise\Nfor you to come with us.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:53.51,0:08:54.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(680,1053)}{\i1}– [STUSSY] Agreed.\N– [NAMI] Ugh.
Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.20,0:08:57.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[USOPP] Stop inviting people\Ninto our house!
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.11,0:08:57.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who raised you?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:57.78,0:08:58.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cut it.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:01.68,0:09:02.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.08,0:09:07.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mr. Appleman!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.31,0:09:08.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.16,0:09:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER] Luffy!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:10.45,0:09:11.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Hey, Chopper!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.22,0:09:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You find 'em?
Dialogue: 50,0:09:13.90,0:09:15.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it's like they disappeared.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:15.89,0:09:16.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] This is weird.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.82,0:09:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hope nothing bad happened.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.51,0:09:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER] I'll check this way.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:20.30,0:09:21.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.10,0:09:22.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] You too!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:22.12,0:09:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER] Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.43,0:09:24.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY] Man, what a mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.10,0:09:27.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop hiding already!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:26.13,0:09:26.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:28.30,0:09:30.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't set sail without you!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:31.64,0:09:33.40,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR] The Straw Hats\Nencountered Bonney
Dialogue: 50,0:09:33.40,0:09:35.80,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,at sea and rescued\Nher from a floating eddy.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:35.88,0:09:39.19,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Afterwards they all traveled\Nto the Future Island, Egghead.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.27,0:09:42.29,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,But their plan encountered\Nan unexpected snag.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.91,0:09:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Old man!
Dialogue: 50,0:09:48.55,0:09:52.76,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR] Dr.\NVegapunk Stella... disappeared.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:55.23,0:09:58.40,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,[NARRATOR] This is Sphinx,\Nin the New World.
Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.48,0:10:01.87,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the hometown of the famous\Npirate Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.34,0:10:07.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was so scared!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:08.36,0:10:10.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're\Nback, Marco!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.61,0:10:12.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wasn't scared at all,\Nfor the record!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.37,0:10:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOY A] The Navy came barging\Nin here outta nowhere!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.05,0:10:17.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARCO] I'm sorry, you guys.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:17.87,0:10:19.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That does sound scary.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.70,0:10:22.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish I'd been here to protect\Nyou from those jerks!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.18,0:10:24.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOY B] Okay, but I said\NI wasn't scared.
Dialogue: 50,0:10:24.15,0:10:26.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So, tell me, what did they do?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.36,0:10:27.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOY A] All sorts of stuff!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.73,0:10:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those Marines were horrible!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.64,0:10:30.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:30.29,0:10:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They wanted\NWhitebeard's treasure!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:32.02,0:10:33.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They were gonna steal it!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.64,0:10:35.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just like a buncha pirates!
Dialogue: 50,0:10:38.32,0:10:39.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:10:39.23,0:10:40.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:43.13,0:10:43.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:10:57.58,0:10:59.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[TOWNSPEOPLE scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:01.81,0:11:04.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drag out the villagers\Nand gather them all here.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.65,0:11:05.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINES] Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.84,0:11:14.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RATEL] I won't harm you as long\Nas you do what I say.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:14.69,0:11:18.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which is quite generous of me,\Nsince you're not protected by the law,
Dialogue: 50,0:11:18.08,0:11:21.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and this island's independent from\Nthe World Government, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.56,0:11:25.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I believe Whitebeard's treasure is\Nhidden somewhere in this country.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:26.09,0:11:27.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tell me where it is, now!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:27.59,0:11:28.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN C] Stop this!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.29,0:11:29.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We don't know what\Nyou're talking about!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:29.92,0:11:32.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've\Nheard of any treasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.92,0:11:33.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RATEL] Oh, well...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:35.03,0:11:37.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's that, I suppose.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:41.06,0:11:42.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I swear...
Dialogue: 50,0:11:42.58,0:11:44.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RATEL] You know what I\Ncall your defiance?
Dialogue: 50,0:11:45.42,0:11:48.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,An act of aggression against\Nthe World Government!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:48.96,0:11:51.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So let's do it this way.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:53.79,0:11:55.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm going to shoot\Nyou one by one.
Dialogue: 50,0:11:56.30,0:11:58.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Till you lead me\Nto the treasure!
Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.60,0:11:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOY B wails]
Dialogue: 50,0:11:59.44,0:12:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:00.40,0:12:01.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The treasure doesn't exist!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:02.42,0:12:04.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't point\Na gun at my brother!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:04.87,0:12:09.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We may not be able to afford your taxes,\Nbut we're still are human beings!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.28,0:12:11.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't treat us like animals!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:11.47,0:12:12.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RATEL] You're not scared?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.10,0:12:16.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know Marco isn't here\Nto protect you right now.
Dialogue: 50,0:12:17.77,0:12:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RATEL] Restrain her!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:19.72,0:12:20.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN B]\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:20.45,0:12:21.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.81,0:12:23.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOY B] Grandma, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:23.58,0:12:24.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You brutes!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.59,0:12:25.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:27.55,0:12:28.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.15,0:12:30.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's not a threat!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:30.35,0:12:31.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't you hurt her!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:33.92,0:12:34.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:34.92,0:12:36.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let them go!
Dialogue: 50,0:12:38.71,0:12:39.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles] Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.14,0:12:43.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhhhhhh! [yelling]
Dialogue: 50,0:12:48.16,0:12:52.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[RATEL yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:13:02.60,0:13:05.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't mess with\Nmy daddy's hometown!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.16,0:13:07.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Or I'll smash you!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.54,0:13:11.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE A]\NIt's Edward Weevil!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:14.18,0:13:15.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE C] Yeah, let's go!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.44,0:13:16.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just leave her!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:17.12,0:13:18.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE D] Why is he here?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:18.19,0:13:21.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought we sent troops to arrest him\Nwhen they shut down the Seven Warlords!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:21.70,0:13:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE E] Yeah, but those troops were\Nnever heard from again!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.26,0:13:24.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE F] No way.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.92,0:13:26.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He beat them all?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:26.41,0:13:27.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's no man!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:27.34,0:13:28.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's a monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.80,0:13:30.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Retreat to the ship for now!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.40,0:13:32.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We'll wait for reinforcements!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.60,0:13:33.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE H] This is Sphinx!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:33.45,0:13:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We were attacked by the former\NWarlord, Edward Weevil!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:36.57,0:13:37.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need backup!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:37.89,0:13:38.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:40.31,0:13:42.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And then\Nthe Marines went away.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:42.41,0:13:44.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They just waited out at sea.
Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.62,0:13:47.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're lucky that big guy\Nshowed up when he did
Dialogue: 50,0:13:47.91,0:13:50.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'cause they were\Nreally gonna shoot us, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.34,0:13:53.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he saved the day, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.19,0:13:55.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad everyone\Nmade it out safe!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.16,0:13:57.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's not the end\Nof the story, Marco!
Dialogue: 50,0:13:57.37,0:14:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone else showed up\Nand ruined everything!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.43,0:14:02.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Navy Admiral Ryokugyu!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:04.69,0:14:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My precious Weevil resisted so bravely,\Nbut that rat took him away!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:09.82,0:14:10.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[BUCKIN] Weevil!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:11.12,0:14:11.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\t(2393,0,1,\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&HFFFFFF&)}[WEEVIL] Mommy!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:15.41,0:14:17.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BUCKIN] You're going to help\Nme get my son back!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.37,0:14:18.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My son.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.01,0:14:20.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And my treasure!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:20.90,0:14:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Edward Newgate's\Ninheritance will be mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:23.06,0:14:23.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.26,0:14:25.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mine!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.38,0:14:35.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just worried sick about my sweet\Nboy, who sacrificed his freedom
Dialogue: 50,0:14:35.29,0:14:36.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,for his daddy's village!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:36.52,0:14:39.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Newgate, what have\Nthey done to our baby?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.56,0:14:39.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 50,0:14:42.61,0:14:44.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At any rate,\NI guess I owe him one.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.50,0:14:46.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad he was\Nhere for the village.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.62,0:14:50.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that tone!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.33,0:14:51.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're just like all the others.
Dialogue: 50,0:14:51.92,0:14:55.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You don't believe Weevil is\NWhitebeard's real son, do you?
Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.86,0:14:58.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I know someone\Nwho can prove it!
Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.48,0:15:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh? Dr. Vegapunk\Nwill show you all!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:11.77,0:15:12.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Admiral!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.54,0:15:15.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We brought teacakes\Nfor your meeting, as you requested!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.30,0:15:18.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIZARU] Ah, you've tested them\Nfor poison, I assume?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:18.52,0:15:19.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE I] Of course!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:19.80,0:15:21.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIZARU]\NI'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:21.09,0:15:22.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At ease, kid.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:22.20,0:15:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:15:32.40,0:15:34.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[knocking]
Dialogue: 50,0:15:36.05,0:15:37.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pardon the intrusion.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.38,0:15:41.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you could use\Nsome refreshments.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:42.46,0:15:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Allow me to serve you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.27,0:15:53.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KIZARU]\NI've been meaning to ask you.
Dialogue: 50,0:15:53.94,0:15:56.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you ever met Dr.\NVegapunk before?
Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.41,0:15:58.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SATURN] I have.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.87,0:16:05.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SATURN] Just once.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.47,0:16:07.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A long time ago.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:07.63,0:16:10.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe\Nthat he betrayed you.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:10.19,0:16:12.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not a bright move\Nfor a genius.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.47,0:16:25.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, I must say,
Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.52,0:16:24.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AGENTS scream]
Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.46,0:16:28.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is quite the regrettable\Nturn of events.
Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.69,0:16:32.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.88,0:16:44.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A pacifista?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:44.73,0:16:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with it?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.10,0:16:46.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:46.56,0:16:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.34,0:16:49.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're attacking\Nthe wrong guys!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:49.26,0:16:51.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're with\Nthe Government, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:51.73,0:16:52.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:16:52.29,0:16:53.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what I said?
Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.62,0:16:54.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:06.74,0:17:07.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Die, you monster!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:10.23,0:17:11.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[AGENT O] Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:12.49,0:17:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.32,0:17:14.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:17.49,0:17:18.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.94,0:17:20.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.32,0:17:32.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell did he just do?
Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.21,0:17:34.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It looked like\Na Bubble Shield!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.32,0:17:36.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They say that's one of Vegapunk's\Ngreatest inventions.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.85,0:17:38.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It has the power\Nto repel anything!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:38.82,0:17:39.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.40,0:17:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's nothing like\Nthe ones in Marineford.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.32,0:17:42.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's a brand new model.
Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.72,0:17:44.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The pacifista Mark III!
Dialogue: 50,0:17:57.14,0:17:59.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx94\b1\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fscy94}Submit and relocate to Factory B.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:03.49,0:18:05.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fscx94\fscy94\b1}[PACIFISTA]\NHostile activity confirmed.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:08.78,0:18:10.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all gonna die.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:10.36,0:18:11.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, don't shoot!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.96,0:18:12.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We surrender!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:12.45,0:18:13.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We surrender!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:20.01,0:18:21.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\fscx94\fscy94\b1}You are under arrest.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:26.06,0:18:27.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, just wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.20,0:18:29.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pacifistas never make\Ndecisions on their own!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.07,0:18:31.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who's giving you\Nthese orders?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:38.09,0:18:39.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CITIZEN B]\NPlease don't move.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:39.32,0:18:40.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You'll open your wounds.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:41.23,0:18:46.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CITIZENS chattering]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:43.48,0:18:45.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And this was supposed\Nto be my day off.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.57,0:18:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How is the pacifista?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:47.18,0:18:48.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it doing its job?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:51.49,0:18:53.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something bad is\Nhappening up there.
Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.89,0:18:55.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk, do you copy?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:55.29,0:18:56.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 50,0:18:57.28,0:18:59.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[static]
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.22,0:18:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Punk?
Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.88,0:18:59.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Say something!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.08,0:19:03.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He can't hear me.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.48,0:19:04.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Dome is closed.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.83,0:19:05.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're shut out.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.26,0:19:07.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Punk.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't protect you.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:09.41,0:19:10.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:10.12,0:19:11.44,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,And take care of Punk!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:11.52,0:19:12.35,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 50,0:19:13.75,0:19:14.65,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.73,0:19:15.61,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:19.24,0:19:21.39,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU] The Navy hasn't\Nstopped communication,
Dialogue: 50,0:19:21.39,0:19:23.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,but they've cut us\Nout of the loop.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.50,0:19:24.87,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess that tells us\Nwhere we stand.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.83,0:19:25.83,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[CITIZENS gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:19:24.87,0:19:25.70,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:29.09,0:19:32.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the world's eyes,\NI'm already a traitor.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.30,0:19:38.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Might as well do\Nas I please, then.
Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.50,0:19:42.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pacifista Mark III, activate!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.72,0:19:47.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[alarm blares]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.74,0:19:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NAll 50 units, dispatch!
Dialogue: 50,0:19:56.60,0:19:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:01.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU] Straw Hat Luffy is\Ngoing to take Dr
Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.50,0:20:03.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk off the island\Naboard his ship!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.88,0:20:07.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your mission is to make\Nsure it departs safely!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.31,0:20:08.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\b1}[PACIFISTAS] Understood.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.12,0:20:14.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SENTOMARU]\NThe Navy is up to something!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:15.70,0:20:17.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep an eye on the shore!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.52,0:20:19.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Something big is\Nabout to happen.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:20.92,0:20:23.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dr. Vegapunk is\Nyour creator. Protect him.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.45,0:20:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect him.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:24.68,0:20:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No matter what,\Nget him off this island!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:30.94,0:20:32.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VEGAPUNK] Bonney, please.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:32.09,0:20:33.52,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,276)}I'm begging you.
Dialogue: 50,0:20:33.60,0:20:35.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,[BONNEY] I've heard\Nenough out of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:20:35.19,0:20:37.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(626.5,1053)}– [thud]\N– [VEGAPUNK screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.12,0:20:37.95,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.17,0:21:36.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.63,0:21:42.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey. What happened to you?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.15,0:21:42.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOY] It's over.
Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.71,0:21:46.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I tried, but I just can't!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.02,0:21:48.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.35,0:21:50.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that you, Dad?
Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.29,0:21:53.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:21:54.80,0:21:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:01.60,0:22:03.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thought you could run, boy?
Dialogue: 50,0:22:03.11,0:22:04.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get on your damn feet!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:04.95,0:22:05.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.84,0:22:06.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.95,0:22:07.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:08.29,0:22:09.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop your whining!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:09.66,0:22:10.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're coming with us!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:11.12,0:22:13.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:13.66,0:22:15.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[screams]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:15.21,0:22:17.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUMA] No! I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:17.63,0:22:18.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.60,0:22:19.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:19.73,0:22:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone help me! Please!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.81,0:22:22.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.69,0:22:23.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop squirming!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:24.30,0:22:25.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Move it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.03,0:22:25.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.89,0:22:27.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're not letting you go!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:27.54,0:22:29.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you escape, they're\Ngonna execute us all!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.04,0:22:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I... I can't!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.62,0:22:32.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go back.
Dialogue: 50,0:22:32.78,0:22:34.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't wanna go back there!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:34.40,0:22:35.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:36.47,0:22:38.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please go away!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.79,0:22:40.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Somebody help!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:38.93,0:22:40.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut your damn mouth!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.41,0:22:44.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[growls] Let him go!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.99,0:22:47.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just leave me!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:47.27,0:22:49.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please don't make\Nme go back!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:51.06,0:22:52.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:52.31,0:22:53.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He said he doesn't want to!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.25,0:22:58.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUMA yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:22:58.04,0:22:58.84,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BONNEY] Wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.47,0:23:00.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.27,0:23:03.03,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Why can't I get closer?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:07.60,0:23:10.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop your crying,\Nyou little shit!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.07,0:23:15.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUMA]\NI can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:23:15.41,0:23:16.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'd rather die!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.42,0:23:18.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're too strong!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.34,0:23:18.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VIGILANTE D] Come here!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.91,0:23:19.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUMA] No!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:20.13,0:23:21.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an1\q2\pos(567.5,1053)}– [VIGILANTE C] Bastard!\N– [KUMA] I'll never go back!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:22.23,0:23:24.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You might as well just kill me!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:24.45,0:23:27.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If I go back, I'll end\Nup dead anyway!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.69,0:23:30.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BONNEY] What?
Dialogue: 50,0:23:30.53,0:23:31.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shut up, kid!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:31.87,0:23:33.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:34.72,0:23:36.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.25,0:23:38.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nooooooo!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.71,0:23:40.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUMA yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:40.85,0:23:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nooooooo!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.13,0:23:47.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VIGILANTES grunting]
Dialogue: 50,0:23:52.43,0:23:53.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[VIGILANTE E] Come on!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.69,0:23:54.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.39,0:23:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You monsters!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:03.33,0:24:04.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[KUMA] It hurts.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.27,0:24:09.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!\NI'm sorry! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:12.07,0:24:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.67,0:24:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let him go!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:28.23,0:24:30.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BONNEY]\NNo. I can't watch this anymore.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:31.47,0:24:35.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can't take it!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:32.26,0:24:33.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH yell]
Dialogue: 50,0:24:35.19,0:24:36.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,62)}Someone help me!
Dialogue: 50,0:24:37.63,0:24:38.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,62)}[BONNEY] No more.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.43,0:24:41.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Please, no more.
Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.83,0:24:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop hurting him!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:02.45,0:25:04.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shoot him down!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.64,0:25:16.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MARINE A] Is continuing\Nto climb the Red Line!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.51,0:25:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He appears to be\Nheading for Mary Geoise!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:19.00,0:25:21.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not let him enter the Holy\NLand, no matter the cost!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:21.92,0:25:24.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Navy's reputation\Nis at stake!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:24.47,0:25:26.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is our sworn duty!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:33.88,0:25:35.51,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BONNEY] My father's past.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:36.57,0:25:38.40,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can face it.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:40.28,0:25:42.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I\Nhave the strength.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:46.75,0:25:47.77,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,[BONNEY] But I have to.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:49.43,0:25:52.56,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,I need to I need\Nto find out the truth!
Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.09,0:25:55.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.38,0:25:57.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm ready, Dad.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.52,0:26:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show me again.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:03.40,0:26:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll stay.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.49,0:26:13.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] What do you mean you\Ncouldn't find Vegapunk?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:13.47,0:26:15.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There are only so many\Nplaces he can be!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:15.75,0:26:18.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's some secret\Npassageway you didn't see?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:18.24,0:26:19.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There must be!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.36,0:26:23.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:23.30,0:26:24.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's gone.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:25.06,0:26:27.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ran everywhere\Nlookin' for the guy...
Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.28,0:26:32.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now I'm dyin'\Nand he's still lost.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.55,0:26:33.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:33.41,0:26:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:34.09,0:26:35.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, really!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:35.10,0:26:37.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The hover function\Non his shoes stopped working!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.33,0:26:38.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think he broke them.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:38.51,0:26:39.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't tell people that!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:39.77,0:26:41.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gonna make\Nme pay for new ones!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.70,0:26:43.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nobody cares about\Nthe damn shoes!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.39,0:26:44.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're all about to die!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:44.64,0:26:46.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If he's not in the lab, then\Nwhere could he have gone?
Dialogue: 50,0:26:46.90,0:26:48.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI]\NJust chill out a sec, Usopp.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.74,0:26:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] We don't have a sec!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.19,0:26:53.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we don't leave now, they're gonna send\Na whole fleet of those suit-wearing sadists
Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.82,0:26:54.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,after us!
Dialogue: 50,0:26:54.47,0:26:57.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We know, but we can't\Nleave without Vegapunk.
Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.96,0:26:58.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LUFFY groans]
Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.16,0:27:00.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck are you tryin'\Nto pull, Mister Apple Man?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:00.85,0:27:02.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bonney's missing, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:02.38,0:27:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe she's calmed\Ndown by now.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.63,0:27:05.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] I know where she is.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:07.58,0:27:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] I can see her right\Nhere on the monitor.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.72,0:27:10.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wait, you found her?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:10.98,0:27:11.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Never lost her.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:11.86,0:27:12.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[STRAW HATS] Never lost her?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.11,0:27:15.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Hey.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:15.87,0:27:16.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a mess.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.99,0:27:18.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hm? Zoro!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:19.00,0:27:20.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought we were settin' sail.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:20.76,0:27:22.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are you doin' just\Nsittin' around in here?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.87,0:27:24.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, we kinda\Nhad some issues.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.76,0:27:27.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, I wouldn't blame you\Nfor wanting to dilly-dally a bit!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:27.59,0:27:28.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just look!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.48,0:27:30.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all so futuristic!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.19,0:27:30.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[CHOPPER] Wow!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:30.81,0:27:31.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll say!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:32.07,0:27:35.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They even invented a high-tech\Nhat that shows off your afro!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.12,0:27:37.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A fishbowl is your idea\Nof high-tech?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.16,0:27:37.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:38.35,0:27:39.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is quite a wreck.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:41.70,0:27:43.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shaka, how's Atlas doing?
Dialogue: 50,0:27:43.89,0:27:44.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Let me see.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.83,0:27:46.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Edison, Lilith. Status report.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:46.75,0:27:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The status is?!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.81,0:27:48.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You still suck!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:49.36,0:27:50.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON] Move, Lilith.
Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.10,0:27:52.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I just finished the repairs\Non Atlas, Shaka!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:52.35,0:27:53.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come see!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.16,0:27:53.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:53.66,0:27:55.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Plural! We just\Nfinished the repairs!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.89,0:27:57.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I worked on her just\Nas much as you did!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:57.70,0:27:58.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 50,0:27:58.55,0:28:00.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, gang!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.35,0:28:02.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess who's back?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:02.44,0:28:05.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm fixed up and ready to go!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.76,0:28:08.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:07.66,0:28:08.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn Atlas!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:08.92,0:28:09.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:11.38,0:28:12.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lilith, look!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:12.36,0:28:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:13.93,0:28:15.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LILITH] Yes, I can see that!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.20,0:28:17.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON]\NGosh, she sure is full of energy!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.22,0:28:18.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I guess we did a good job!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.08,0:28:25.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, girl.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:25.77,0:28:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey. Lookin' good.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.49,0:28:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:27.98,0:28:29.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you just wake up now?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.24,0:28:30.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You kind of missed a lot!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.68,0:28:33.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you want, I'll smack\Nthe drowsies right out of you!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.35,0:28:36.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout you don't\Nand say you did?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:34.08,0:28:35.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[chuckles]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:39.15,0:28:40.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, good.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:40.12,0:28:41.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm glad her face got better.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.54,0:28:43.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SANJI yells]
Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.82,0:28:43.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON] We had replacement\Nparts ready.
Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.68,0:28:44.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh! Hey!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.20,0:28:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:46.24,0:28:48.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the little guy\Nwho saved my bacon!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.52,0:28:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch, bud!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:49.58,0:28:50.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No prob!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:51.77,0:28:54.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you've started beating\Nup little girls now, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:28:54.47,0:28:58.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You creeps are every bit as rotten\Nas you were when we first met you!
Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.13,0:29:02.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you so much as look at Robin again,\NI'll put you straight in the ground!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.88,0:29:03.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ROBIN] Nami.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:03.50,0:29:04.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:04.24,0:29:06.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's nothing they\Ncan do to me now.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.59,0:29:10.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That said, I wanted to see Stella,\Nbut it seems something happened?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.90,0:29:14.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Unfortunately, we've been faced\Nwith two unpleasant surprises.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:14.85,0:29:17.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,First: Stella has disappeared.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:18.12,0:29:20.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And Second: We've lost control\Nof the Frontier Dome.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.98,0:29:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:23.05,0:29:24.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And what does\Nthat mean for us?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:25.69,0:29:30.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] It means, for the time being, we're\Ntrapped inside the Labophase with no escape.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.34,0:29:31.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH gasp]
Dialogue: 50,0:29:31.88,0:29:35.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] If anyone tries to leave, laser beams\Nwill incinerate them immediately.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:35.78,0:29:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:37.12,0:29:40.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're supposed to take Vegapunk\Nto sea like, urgently, aren't we?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.54,0:29:43.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Ideally, but we can't do\Nthat while he's missing.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:43.16,0:29:45.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Then what are we\Nsupposed to do?!
Dialogue: 50,0:29:45.92,0:29:47.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA]\NLet me handle the Dome.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:47.42,0:29:48.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You go look for Stella.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:49.45,0:29:51.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's the only solution\Nafforded to us.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:52.02,0:29:53.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quick question.
Dialogue: 50,0:29:53.15,0:29:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You got monitors that show the whole lab,\Nbut you said you can't see Vegapunk on 'em,
Dialogue: 50,0:29:56.94,0:29:59.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,so what's the point in us\Nsearchin' the place?
Dialogue: 50,0:29:59.37,0:30:02.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] Normally, we can see everything,\Nbut not at the moment.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:03.03,0:30:06.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The seraphim's rampage did\Nquite a number on this place.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:06.17,0:30:09.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Many of the Cam-snails are\Neither lost or unconscious.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:10.44,0:30:13.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need everyone to check\Nthe unsurveilled areas.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:13.76,0:30:17.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stella could be incapacitated\Nin one of the Cam-snail blind spots.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:18.28,0:30:20.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[PYTHAGORAS]\NShaka. This is Pythagoras.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:20.32,0:30:23.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm on the third floor of Building C,\Nand it's crickets up here.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:23.90,0:30:24.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[SHAKA] I see.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:25.06,0:30:27.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then check the next building\Nover, while you're there.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:27.58,0:30:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NWe should start looking, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:29.11,0:30:31.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The sooner we get out of here\Nthe better, after all.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:31.99,0:30:34.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I might find some future\Ntreasure along the way!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:35.02,0:30:36.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That sounds delightful!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:36.49,0:30:37.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I think I'll come, too!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:37.68,0:30:39.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON] Hey, I don't like\Nthe sound of that!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:39.57,0:30:41.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys aren't gonna\Nstart any trouble, are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:41.52,0:30:43.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BROOK]\NWe would never! Right, Nami?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:43.99,0:30:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[NAMI]\NYeah, let's go with that.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:45.24,0:30:46.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON]\NThat wasn't convincing at all.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:46.61,0:30:47.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay where I can see you!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:48.07,0:30:49.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you don't mind,\NI'll search as well.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:49.80,0:30:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not like him\Nto disappear like this.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:51.97,0:30:53.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mind if I come\Nalong with you?
Dialogue: 50,0:30:53.69,0:30:54.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:54.56,0:30:55.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm grateful.
Dialogue: 50,0:30:55.36,0:30:56.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Susie!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:57.13,0:30:58.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let me come, too, please!
Dialogue: 50,0:30:58.69,0:31:01.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'll follow you\Nto the ends of the earth!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:01.23,0:31:02.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Alright.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:02.54,0:31:04.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Guess I'd better go, too.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:04.39,0:31:05.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hold up, Mosshead!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:05.56,0:31:06.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's your deal?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:06.58,0:31:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm lookin' for some\Napple guy, right?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:08.55,0:31:09.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Easy.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:09.48,0:31:10.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not for you!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:10.58,0:31:11.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:11.94,0:31:13.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:13.22,0:31:14.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, knock it off!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:14.20,0:31:15.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is your problem?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:15.66,0:31:18.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you're out searching, then\Nwho's gonna search for you?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:18.88,0:31:19.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Come on, man.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:20.32,0:31:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji's right!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:21.00,0:31:22.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro, please don't go.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:22.75,0:31:23.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] You too?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:23.60,0:31:24.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, really.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:24.40,0:31:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Be a good boy and stay here.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:26.41,0:31:27.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Whatever.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:27.56,0:31:29.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get our search\Non, my bros!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:29.70,0:31:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I won't let Vegapunk down!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:31.49,0:31:33.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it's like a maze out there!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:33.08,0:31:35.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I've got a really bad\Nfeeling about this!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:35.20,0:31:37.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we're not Zoro,\Nwe still might get lost!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:37.85,0:31:40.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[LILITH] How did you guys ever\Nmake it out of a port?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:40.45,0:31:41.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just follow me!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:41.63,0:31:42.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[USOPP] Really?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:42.39,0:31:43.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:44.16,0:31:45.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,York, are you asleep again?
Dialogue: 50,0:31:45.70,0:31:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We need help.
Dialogue: 50,0:31:46.48,0:31:48.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can nap once\Nwe're on the ship. Get!
Dialogue: 50,0:31:50.69,0:31:53.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[yawns]
Dialogue: 50,0:31:57.61,0:32:02.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[ZORO] Don't know why they wanted me to stick around\Nso bad, but I guess it's fine.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:03.02,0:32:06.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm sure findin' one old man\Nwon't be too hard for them.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:06.11,0:32:08.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But damn, you really\Nwent all out, huh?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:10.12,0:32:11.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[groans] I always...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:12.27,0:32:13.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...go all out.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:13.93,0:32:15.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fair enough.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:15.89,0:32:19.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I never thought I'd\Nsee these assholes again.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:19.36,0:32:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Really takes me back.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:20.84,0:32:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember Water Seven?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:22.37,0:32:23.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ice Pops' place!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:23.78,0:32:25.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder how he's doin'.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:32.48,0:32:35.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[MORGANS] Now there's a scoop\Nif I ever heard one!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:35.49,0:32:38.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who would've thunk\Nthe Government's power-drunk,
Dialogue: 50,0:32:38.35,0:32:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and they're coming\Nfor Vegapunk!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:40.82,0:32:43.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gunning for the greatest\Nminds in the world again?
Dialogue: 50,0:32:43.52,0:32:46.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems Ohara was a big\Nenough hit to get a sequel.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:46.59,0:32:48.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But they'll be\Nhard-pressed to spin this.
Dialogue: 50,0:32:48.97,0:32:51.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk's a hero\Nall across the seas!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:51.84,0:32:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He brought light\Nto towns all around!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:53.71,0:32:56.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,His energy tech made\Nhim a shining star!
Dialogue: 50,0:32:56.54,0:32:58.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But he's sharing\Nthe stage on Egghead...
Dialogue: 50,0:32:58.99,0:33:00.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...with him!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:01.13,0:33:02.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ha-ha! Fire up the presses!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:02.96,0:33:06.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The World Economic Journal's got\Na scorching hot new front-page story.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:06.76,0:33:08.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the headline is...
Dialogue: 50,0:33:08.58,0:33:13.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Emperor of the Sea, Straw Hat Luffy Wages\NWar with the Navy on Egghead and Holds.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:13.32,0:33:13.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,War!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:13.81,0:33:15.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it's Dr.\NVegapunk Hostage!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:15.24,0:33:18.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No better villain than\Na pirate, am I right?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:18.08,0:33:22.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Now, when the Government kills Vegapunk,\Nthey won't get any bad publicity!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:22.59,0:33:25.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And they'll be grateful\Nfor my impeccable journalism.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:25.31,0:33:27.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remind them we\Ntake donations.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:27.19,0:33:27.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[REPORTER A] Yes,\Nsir! [laughs]
Dialogue: 50,0:33:30.24,0:33:31.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're not a journalist.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:34.44,0:33:36.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're just spinning\Nridiculous lies!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:36.78,0:33:39.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy would never do\Nsuch a horrible thing!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:39.14,0:33:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You and the government\Nare pathetic!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:41.40,0:33:42.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:42.09,0:33:44.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down,\Nare you crazy?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:44.08,0:33:46.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Government could be listening\Nto our every word right now!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:46.84,0:33:48.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What if they've got\Nthe whole place bugged?
Dialogue: 50,0:33:48.87,0:33:50.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're gonna\Nsquash us like bugs!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:51.16,0:33:51.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So zip it!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:52.01,0:33:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And don't forget,\NMorgy is savin' our asses!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:54.25,0:33:55.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get off his tailfeathers!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:55.94,0:33:56.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 50,0:33:57.04,0:33:58.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will not be silent about this!
Dialogue: 50,0:33:58.86,0:34:01.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What gives you the right to twist\Nthe truth for your own gain?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:01.72,0:34:03.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Have you no\Nsense of decency?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:03.92,0:34:05.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[GIRLS squeal]
Dialogue: 50,0:34:05.04,0:34:06.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those are my clothes\Nshe's wearing, you know!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:06.95,0:34:08.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I'll never\Nwash them again!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:08.74,0:34:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:11.02,0:34:13.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[BOTH] Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:13.91,0:34:16.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[grunts] You were crying your eyes\Nout yesterday, little girl!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:16.49,0:34:20.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And today you're all high and mighty\Ntelling me how to do my job?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:20.19,0:34:22.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm a mover and a shaker!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:22.09,0:34:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A big news maker!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:23.74,0:34:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 50,0:34:25.34,0:34:27.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Newspapers are\Nentertainment!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:27.47,0:34:31.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So I don't care if\Nthey're true or not!
Dialogue: 50,0:34:33.98,0:34:34.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How.
Dialogue: 50,0:05:01.32,0:05:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON] No, Lilith, wait!
Dialogue: 50,0:06:21.78,0:06:23.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,[EDISON] Are you okay, Lilith?
Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.95,0:08:37.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\i1}[FRANKY] Wow! Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.11,0:01:33.49,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\1c&HE6E6E6&\1a&HFF&\blur0.75\fad(731,0)\bord2.7\t(689,731,\1a&H00&)\pos(960,850)}Miss Buckingham Stussy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.11,0:01:33.49,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\c&HE6E6E6&\blur0.8\fad(731,0)\pos(960,850)}Miss Buckingham Stussy
